<p>In the latest development in the Iran war, an Iranian strike on Prince Sultan Air Base in Saudi Arabia wounded 10 to 12 US service members, according to multiple reports citing US officials. Two of the troops were described as seriously injured. The attack also damaged several US aircraft at a key American military facility in the kingdom. The immediate significance is clear: a base long used by the United States in Saudi Arabia has now suffered both personnel casualties and equipment damage. That underscores the growing risks to forces and infrastructure across the region.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/hslNdxAP4cYideeS1csgmQh5bwDbYrrq62J0X_b6zLdAcjF0IoXw9jwQ_d3MS7HjAf7g2G0OBlrThByIW_BCsKJDBuuMhs6bR3OQGsgDLQHbiZ6W9oNqJ-_v35UtuIleooBXeOn1VPAndf3egz5jtEgFRlshMSQFxWdtZEj0Vn_G3s4kxTw0bPevzG8sbPbadME3qck7CJ5FhLl3_bzHCuygW_hgJiMOEQapE1mXgOuQpQ8y4cmfQ_8Oh1w' alt='Image from reporting on the Iran war as US troops were wounded at Prince Sultan Air Base' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Satellite imagery: SCMP said satellite images appeared to show damage at Prince Sultan Air Base after the strike.</li><li>Defense breach: The New York Times called the strike one of the most serious breaches of American defenses since the war began on February 28.</li><li>Escalation planning: RT said the Pentagon was considering deploying a third aircraft carrier, the USS George H.W. Bush, to the Middle East while drafting options for a &quot;final blow&quot; against Iran.</li><li>Sorties milestone: RT said the US military had touted reaching 10,000 sorties since the war began.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>US officials: In the first public accounts after the strike, U.S. officials gave slightly different casualty estimates, suggesting the post-strike assessment was still coming into focus. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/10-americans-injured-in-iranian-attack-on-saudi-airbase/'>CBS News</a>, <a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3348220/iran-strike-wounds-us-troops-and-damages-planes-saudi-airbase'>SCMP</a>, <a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-troops-wounded-in-iran-strike-on-base-in-saudi-arabia-us-official-says/article70795431.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Iran: Iran has cast the strike campaign as retaliation and accused Gulf countries of letting their territory be used for U.S. operations against Iran. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-troops-wounded-in-iran-strike-on-base-in-saudi-arabia-us-official-says/article70795431.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Trump administration: RT reported that President Trump said Iran was being &quot;decimated&quot; and claimed there were only &quot;3,554 targets left&quot; to strike, while envoy Steve Witkoff said he remained hopeful about talks this week. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/636460-iran-war-live-updates/'>RT</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-us-troops-wounded-in-strike-on-saudi-base/live-76573681'>Iran war: US troops wounded in strike on Saudi base</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3348220/iran-strike-wounds-us-troops-and-damages-planes-saudi-airbase'>Iran strike wounds US troops and damages planes at Saudi airbase</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/636460-iran-war-live-updates/'>More US troops injured, refueling jets damaged as Iran war enters second month (PHOTOS, VIDEOS)</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/10-americans-injured-in-iranian-attack-on-saudi-airbase/'>10 Americans injured in Iranian attack on Saudi air base</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/iran-war-irans-nuclear-sites-hit-us-troops-injured-at-saudi-arabia-prince-sultan-air-base-base-as-war-enters-2nd-month-11277469#publisher=newsstand'>US Troops Injured At Saudi Base, Iran&#x27;s Nuclear Sites Hit As War Enters 2nd Month</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/new